LIFECYCLE BAKEOFF — R35 (oracle/EWC brackets) — s2/lifecycle_bakeoff.py
Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B, RTX 4090, 6 rounds x 40, 2 SEEDS, PYTHONHASHSEED=0, scaffold-shared.
Adds the upper/lower brackets around R33's replay-consolidation, per codex:
- oracle  = gold-old replay UPPER bracket (old streams replayed with gold answer CE; sequential,
  NOT full joint retraining; uses_gold_old=True).
- ewc     = ewc_fixed (canonical online-EWC on a FIXED top-GROW base layer set, no growth, no
  replay; diagonal Fisher penalty lambda=100) — tests if regularization can replace replay.
New metrics: ORACLE_GAP, mean_forgetting across ALL streams, age_curve (final per-stream seen).

